This site exists three times over, once per theme baudelaire ships, and the
content is identical in all three. Whatever differs between them is the theme:
the type, the colours, the furniture around the words.

Every page here is a `.typ` file. The posts carry dates, tags and summaries, so
the listing, the term pages and the feeds all have something real to show.

Have a look at #link("/posts/")[the posts], or at a
#link("/tags/typst/")[tag page], and then read
#link("https://baudelaire.cstef.dev/features/build/themes/")[how themes work].
